<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2641982601"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1777244597"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Heaven's ray"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="rinahamu / KOTONOHOUSE / Pure 100%"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Heaven's ray"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:18.570"><div begin="00:23.145" end="03:18.570"><p begin="00:23.145" end="00:26.048" itunes:key="L1">掛かる虹思い出す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挂在天边的彩虹，让我想起了</span></p><p begin="00:26.049" end="00:27.149" itunes:key="L2">忘れてない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些深藏心底的片段</span></p><p begin="00:27.150" end="00:28.890" itunes:key="L3">Ladybug<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">瓢虫翩跹</span></p><p begin="00:28.891" end="00:30.709" itunes:key="L4">夢の中うごく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在梦境里轻轻舞动</span></p><p begin="00:30.710" end="00:31.444" itunes:key="L5">Shadow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朦胧的阴影</span></p><p begin="00:31.445" end="00:32.878" itunes:key="L6">また会えるって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否还能再见？</span></p><p begin="00:32.879" end="00:34.441" itunes:key="L7">Smiling above?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会不会在天空微笑？</span></p><p begin="00:34.442" end="00:37.553" itunes:key="L8">穴の空いた感情が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">空虚的情感</span></p><p begin="00:37.554" end="00:40.425" itunes:key="L9">永遠と続く狭間<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">徘徊于无尽的缝隙间</span></p><p begin="00:40.426" end="00:41.477" itunes:key="L10">星になった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终凝结为星光</span></p><p begin="00:41.478" end="00:42.880" itunes:key="L11">Bright star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化作一颗寂静的微光之星</span></p><p begin="00:42.881" end="00:43.496" itunes:key="L12">Let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请告诉我</span></p><p begin="00:43.497" end="00:44.282" itunes:key="L13">Let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请让我知道</span></p><p begin="00:44.283" end="00:45.080" itunes:key="L14">揺れる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我那摇摆的</span></p><p begin="00:45.081" end="00:45.860" itunes:key="L15">Soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">灵魂是否还能安定？</span></p><p begin="00:45.861" end="00:48.627" itunes:key="L16">レーゾンデートル泣いてないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要流泪</span></p><p begin="00:48.628" end="00:51.423" itunes:key="L17">不安なんかおさらばして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告别不安吧</span></p><p begin="00:51.424" end="00:54.356" itunes:key="L18">レーゾンデートル歌って繋いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你的声音唱响，连接起一切</span></p><p begin="00:54.357" end="00:57.262" itunes:key="L19">超えて今を生きたいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越过这一刻，追寻更远的未来</span></p><p begin="00:57.263" end="01:00.037" itunes:key="L20">レーゾンデートル泣いてないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要哭泣</span></p><p begin="01:00.038" end="01:02.715" itunes:key="L21">不安なんかおさらばして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摒弃那些不安吧</span></p><p begin="01:02.716" end="01:05.415" itunes:key="L22">レーゾンデートル歌って繋いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用你的歌声，将时间紧紧缝合</span></p><p begin="01:05.416" end="01:05.883" itunes:key="L23">Remember<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需要记得</span></p><p begin="01:05.884" end="01:31.347" itunes:key="L24">フューチャーみてたいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自己仍渴望着看见明天</span></p><p begin="01:31.348" end="01:32.745" itunes:key="L25">Feel the breeze<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感受着徐徐的微风</span></p><p begin="01:32.746" end="01:34.286" itunes:key="L26">感じたいよただ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想静静感受着这一瞬</span></p><p begin="01:34.287" end="01:35.634" itunes:key="L27">Hold the light<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中充满着光</span></p><p begin="01:35.635" end="01:37.150" itunes:key="L28">溺れないでまだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要止步于此</span></p><p begin="01:37.151" end="01:38.537" itunes:key="L29">数字のタトゥー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些刻在皮肤上的数字</span></p><p begin="01:38.538" end="01:39.398" itunes:key="L30">塞いでる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被无形的遮盖</span></p><p begin="01:39.399" end="01:40.126" itunes:key="L31">Noise<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被无形的噪音遮盖住</span></p><p begin="01:40.127" end="01:42.919" itunes:key="L32">同じ気持ちもう戻れない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">熟悉的情感已无法追溯</span></p><p begin="01:42.920" end="01:43.955" itunes:key="L33">明日なんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛明天</span></p><p begin="01:43.956" end="01:44.683" itunes:key="L34">無いって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从未存在过一样</span></p><p begin="01:44.684" end="01:45.205" itunes:key="L35">はぁ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻声叹息</span></p><p begin="01:45.206" end="01:45.804" itunes:key="L36">ヘラたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使脆弱</span></p><p begin="01:45.805" end="01:46.531" itunes:key="L37">分からない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也无法明白</span></p><p begin="01:46.532" end="01:47.063" itunes:key="L38">Life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生命的真谛</span></p><p begin="01:47.064" end="01:47.371" itunes:key="L39">惑う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在迷雾中彷徨</span></p><p begin="01:47.372" end="01:47.957" itunes:key="L40">My mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心中复杂的情感</span></p><p begin="01:47.958" end="01:48.772" itunes:key="L41">今更<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今</span></p><p begin="01:48.773" end="01:52.558" itunes:key="L42">感情が胸の中咲いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也终于得以绽放</span></p><p begin="01:52.559" end="01:54.952" itunes:key="L43">匂いがした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">空气中淡淡弥漫着它的气息</span></p><p begin="01:54.953" end="01:57.593" itunes:key="L44">掛かる虹思い出す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那彩虹再次映入眼帘</span></p><p begin="01:57.594" end="01:58.771" itunes:key="L45">忘れてない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">某些记忆的片段始终未曾遗忘</span></p><p begin="01:58.772" end="02:00.422" itunes:key="L46">Ladybug<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">瓢虫游走</span></p><p begin="02:00.423" end="02:02.108" itunes:key="L47">夢の中うごく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦的边界被微光打破</span></p><p begin="02:02.109" end="02:02.883" itunes:key="L48">Shadow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那模糊的人影</span></p><p begin="02:02.884" end="02:04.216" itunes:key="L49">また会えるって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许某天还能与其相逢？</span></p><p begin="02:04.217" end="02:05.829" itunes:key="L50">Smiling above?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会否在星光下展露笑颜？</span></p><p begin="02:05.830" end="02:08.940" itunes:key="L51">穴の空いた感情が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">空虚的情感</span></p><p begin="02:08.941" end="02:11.798" itunes:key="L52">永遠と続く狭間<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">游走于时间的罅隙间</span></p><p begin="02:11.799" end="02:12.888" itunes:key="L53">星になった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化为遥远的星辰</span></p><p begin="02:12.889" end="02:14.319" itunes:key="L54">Bright star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个黯淡却倔强的光点</span></p><p begin="02:14.320" end="02:14.989" itunes:key="L55">Let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请告诉我吧</span></p><p begin="02:14.990" end="02:15.752" itunes:key="L56">Let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我明白吧</span></p><p begin="02:15.753" end="02:16.459" itunes:key="L57">Let me know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我知晓吧</span></p><p begin="02:16.460" end="02:19.371" itunes:key="L58">Heaven's ray<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天堂的光芒穿透夜空，洒落人间</span></p><p begin="02:19.372" end="02:21.472" itunes:key="L59">Heaven's ray<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它触碰灵魂，却无声无息</span></p><p begin="02:21.473" end="02:24.967" itunes:key="L60">Heaven's ray<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天堂的光芒穿透夜空，洒落人间</span></p><p begin="02:24.968" end="02:28.220" itunes:key="L61">Heaven's ray<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留下一丝永恒的痕迹</span></p><p begin="02:28.221" end="02:31.470" itunes:key="L62">レーゾンデートル泣いてないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要哭泣，去寻找存在的理由</span></p><p begin="02:31.471" end="02:34.298" itunes:key="L63">不安なんかおさらばして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让恐惧从此远去</span></p><p begin="02:34.299" end="02:37.184" itunes:key="L64">レーゾンデートル歌って繋いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用歌声将片段串联</span></p><p begin="02:37.185" end="02:40.023" itunes:key="L65">超えて今を生きたいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘掉过去不快的回忆</span></p><p begin="02:40.024" end="02:42.876" itunes:key="L66">レーゾンデートル泣いてないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要让泪水停留</span></p><p begin="02:42.877" end="02:45.663" itunes:key="L67">不安なんかおさらばして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与所有的不安告别</span></p><p begin="02:45.664" end="02:48.404" itunes:key="L68">レーゾンデートル歌って繋いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">歌声中连接起未来的每一秒</span></p><p begin="02:48.405" end="02:49.065" itunes:key="L69">Remember<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记住</span></p><p begin="02:49.066" end="02:51.887" itunes:key="L70">フューチャーみてたいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要的只是望向更遥远的未来</span></p><p begin="02:51.888" end="02:54.727" itunes:key="L71">掛かる虹思い出す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挂在天边的彩虹，映出所有回忆</span></p><p begin="02:54.728" end="02:55.794" itunes:key="L72">忘れてない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中未曾抹去的影像</span></p><p begin="02:55.795" end="02:57.570" itunes:key="L73">Ladybug<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">瓢虫轻舞，梦的深处脚步交错</span></p><p begin="02:57.571" end="02:59.323" itunes:key="L74">夢の中うごく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在空灵的梦幻中</span></p><p begin="02:59.324" end="03:00.097" itunes:key="L75">Shadow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摇曳的阴影</span></p><p begin="03:00.098" end="03:01.427" itunes:key="L76">また会えるって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是否还能再次相见？</span></p><p begin="03:01.428" end="03:18.570" itunes:key="L77">Smiling above?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会否在云端笑着守望？</span></p></div></body></tt>